{"text": "Moon Girl.\n\nNia was born on the Moon, and she wanted to see rain.\n\nIt was the year 2091. Nia was thirteen. She lived in Lunaria, a small town under a glass roof. Her mum and dad were scientists there.\n\nOn the Moon, the sky was always black. The weather was always the same. Every day was clean, quiet and dry.\n\nFrom her bedroom window, Nia could see the Earth. It was blue and white, and very far away.\n\n\"What is rain really like?\" she often asked.\n\nHer parents remembered rain, but they never agreed. Mum said it was cold. Dad said it was warm. Nia wanted to know for herself.\n\nNia had a friend on Earth. His name was Leo, and he was thirteen too. They wrote to each other every week.\n\nLeo and his grandma had a farm in a hot, dry valley.\n\nHis letters were full of things Nia never saw. Dogs. Wind. Trees taller than houses.\n\nHer favourite letter was about rain.\n\n\"Rain is not only water,\" Leo wrote. \"It has a smell. Grandma says the earth smells sweet after rain. You can't smell it anywhere else.\"\n\nNia read that letter ten times. A smell!\n\n\"I'm going to smell it one day,\" she wrote back. \"I promise.\"\n\nBut going to Earth was not easy. The Earth was much bigger than the Moon. Everything there was six times heavier.\n\n\"Your legs are going to feel like stone,\" said Dr Ansel.\n\nSo every morning, Nia trained in the sports room. She walked in heavy shoes. She ran on a machine that made her body heavier.\n\nIt was hard. Some days she wanted to stop.\n\nThen she remembered Leo's letter. The sweet smell of the earth after rain.\n\nAnd she put on the heavy shoes again.\n\nOne evening, Mum came home with a big smile.\n\n\"Nia, sit down,\" she said. \"I have news.\"\n\nMum put a small blue card on the table.\n\n\"Is that…?\" asked Nia.\n\n\"Yes. It's your ticket to Earth. We're going to visit Leo's family for two weeks.\"\n\nNia jumped up so high that her head touched the roof. On the Moon, that was easy.\n\nShe wrote to Leo that night. \"I'm coming! Is it going to rain?\"\n\nLeo's answer came three days later. It was very short.\n\n\"Come,\" he wrote. \"But there is no rain here. The last rain was forty days ago.\"", "textSha256": "75ec4460d571c335ad42a68f2ffbb718a2a000bb6d7e08193b11cdaab79e3b59", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.95, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "o", "o", "n", " ", "G", "i", "r", "l", ".", "\n", "\n", "N", "i", "a", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "o", "r", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "o", "o", "n", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "r", "a", "i", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", " ", "2", "0", "9", "1", ".", " ", "N", "i", "a", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "t", "e", "e", "n", ".", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "L", "u", "n", "a", "r", "i", "a", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "o", "w", "n", " ", "u", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "g", "l", "a", "s", "s", " ", "r", "o", "o", "f", ".", " ", "H", "e", "r", " ", "m", "u", "m", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "a", "d", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "s", "c", "i", "e", "n", "t", "i", "s", "t", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "o", "o", "n", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "k", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "l", "w", "a", "y", "s", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "e", "a", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "l", "w", "a", "y", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", ".", " ", "E", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "l", "e", "a", "n", ",", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "r", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "F", "r", "o", "m", " ", "h", "e", "r", 